{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bazar Simulator Online</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the shoes of young Wan, who is in charge of managing his uncle Wang Long's bazaar. After \u201cBazaar Simulator: Wan's Story,\u201d he will take over the bazaar with his friends Tomasito and Eugenio.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What can you do in the game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccb Manage the bazaar cooperatively with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and customize: Choose furniture, paint the walls, and customize the floor to your liking. Purchase upgrades: Expand and improve your store to attract more customers. Keep things tidy: Restock merchandise, organize shelves, and keep your customers happy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096850?t=1762074109","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096850/7011a55b29db029c6d0712fbef5f93ec6f2d1ce5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762074109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096850/288037668c78cc58c11b27d2e9b8613556941be2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762074109","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096850/288037668c78cc58c11b27d2e9b8613556941be2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762074109","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bazar Simulator Online</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the shoes of young Wan, who is in charge of managing his uncle Wang Long's bazaar. After \u201cBazaar Simulator: Wan's Story,\u201d he will take over the bazaar with his friends Tomasito and Eugenio.</p><h2 class=\"bb_